 o we can start on time.  We will take a short break for lunch between 12:3
 0 and 1:00 pm so bring your lunch and a beverage.  About the instructor: C
 atherine Cruz is a French-American artist whose work is informed by textur
 es and patterns created by the passing of time and the effects of the natu
 ral elements on the built environment.  She holds a Bachelor of Science in
