DESCRIPTION:Science Buzz Cafe - The Science of Motherhood in Collaboration
  with Knowable Magazine\n\n  \n    \n      \n        \n          $0.00\n  
       \n      \n    \n  \n\nMonday\, August 10\, 6:00pmPLEASE NOTE - this 
 event is at Hopmonk Sebastopol in conjunction with Kate Haug: Collaborativ
 e Practices exhibitionhttps://knowablemagazine.orghttps://www.sciencebuzzc
 afe.org/"The Science of Motherhood: The Amazing Adaptive Powers of Breastm
 ilk"Eva Emerson\, Science Writer and Editor of Knowable Magazine\, will di
 scuss all the wondrous and often overlooked powers of breastmilk. Breastmi
 lk is often a human's first form of nourishment outside the womb and it is
  a miraculous mother creation that adapts to the baby's individual needs. 
 Learn about the power of breastmilk and its special capacity to protect ba
 bies from disease and to support babies growth and development.  This tal
 k is part of  Kate Haug's "Collaborative Practices" exhibition at the Seb
 astopol Center for the Arts\, August 8 - September 6\, 2026.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
 \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n          \n          
